        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\$17\\,712$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Depreciation}&=\\text{initial value}-\\text{final value}\\\\\\text{Depreciation}&=30\\,000-12\\,288\\\\\\text{Depreciation}&=17\\,712\\end{align*}$$\nThe car depreciated by $\\$17\\,712$.",
